<title>NORWAY: Japan P.M. stresses no past sale of US treasuries.</title>
<headline>Japan P.M. stresses no past sale of US treasuries.</headline>
<dateline>BERGEN, Norway 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto, commenting on his remarks in New York earlier this week about U.S. treasury bills, said on Thursday that he stressed that Japan did not sell U.S. treasuries in the past.</p>
</text>
